1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:03,120
(Sheldon:)but good job, Howard!

2
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:08,620
(Howard:)Thanks. Our culprit
is one Mr. Todd Zarnecki, 2711

3
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:09,820
(Howard:)Ocean View Road,

4
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:11,390
(Howard:)Carlsbad, California.

5
00:00:11,390 --> 00:00:14,400
(Sheldon:)The name and the address
drip with evil.

6
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,730
(Raj:)What else do we know about him?

7
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:17,550
Why, quite a
bit, actually.

8
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:20,770
(Leonard:)I'll bet he's some loser
who lives with his parents.

9
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:27,940
(Howard:)Yes, he does live
with his parents.

10
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:32,250
(Howard:)Here's a Google Earth
shot of their house.

11
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:34,220
(Sheldon:)Excellent!
It's in a cul-de-sac.

12
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,380
(Sheldon:)We can box him in.

13
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:38,290
(Leonard:)Hold on, you're thinking
of going there?

14
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:40,620
(Sheldon:)Carlsbad is only
a couple of hours away.

15
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:41,540
(Policeman:)Fine.

16
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:43,490
(Leonard:)You walk up to the house,
knock on the door

17
00:00:43,490 --> 00:00:45,490
(Leonard:)and demand your stuff back.
What if he says no?

18
00:00:45,490 --> 00:00:47,730
(Sheldon:)I don't know if you've been
following the news, Leonard,

19
00:00:47,730 --> 00:00:49,530
(Sheldon:)but there have been
some terrific advancements

20
00:00:49,530 --> 00:00:51,130
(Sheldon:)in the field of torture.

21
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,600
(Leonard:)No one's getting tortured.

22
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,840
(Sheldon:)Fine, we'll abide by
the Geneva Convention.

23
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:58,270
But ask yourself this:

24
00:00:58,270 --> 00:01:00,310
(Sheldon:)in the course
of our lives,

